    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "Our framework has important implications for the development and evaluation of language models. <strong>By recognizing the uncertainty and variability in evaluation scores, we can make more informed decisions about model selection and development</strong>. This can help to improve the overall performance and reliability of language models, and can also facilitate more nuanced and informative comparisons between models.",
